  "limitations": [
    "The pull/drive pad writer and the interrupt enable/commit routine execute in an emulator over authored controller structs, authored MMIO pad/handshake banks and an authored 16-row callback table. No hardware GPIO pin, interrupt or commit acknowledgement is delivered.",
    "The configuration gate 0x80d341d8, the scheduler-state reader 0x80d362b0 and the critical save/restore wrappers 0x80d379ee/0x80d37a1a are supplied return stubs; their own behavior is covered by MAIN_PM_WAKE and MAIN_RTOS_CRITICAL_SECTIONS. The commit handshake on 0x900080b0 reads authored memory, so no real hardware acknowledgement latency is modeled.",
